[np]

[mion storage="B_seifuku_M AB1_1_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00080_012.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「然后呢？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「然后…那个，捡橡皮擦时候的事…真的很羞耻啊」
[np]

[mion storage="D_seifuku_M CD1_2_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00080_013.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_2_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「啊，那个啊。虽然时机很难把握，不过效果倒是超出预期呢」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「诶…故意的？」
[np]

[mion storage="C_seifuku_M CD1_10_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00080_014.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_10_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「这不是理所当然的吗？既然有下仆在旁边，为什么要我亲自捡橡皮擦」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]啊对哦，我好像是下仆来着。才不是咧。先不说这个…
[np]

[mion storage="A_seifuku_M AB1_1_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00080_015.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_1_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「嗯，原来如此…看来这个情境可以好好利用呢…」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]前辈一边继续记笔记，一边用认真的眼神凝视着屏幕。
[np]

[character name="ryuichi"]
【龙一】[r]「那个，使用是要…用来做什么？」
[np]

[mion storage="C_seifuku_M CD1_3_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00080_016.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_3_FACE_seifuku"]
【澪音】[r]「小说素材。目前正在写的」
